        <title-group>
          <article-title lang="original"><![CDATA[이청준 소설 속 인물들의 자기기만과 실존의 조건 탐색]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="foreign"><![CDATA[Self-Deceit of Yi Cheong-joon's Characters and Examination on Condition of Existence]]></article-title>
          <article-title lang="english"><![CDATA[Self-Deceit of Yi Cheong-joon's Characters and Examination on Condition of Existence]]></article-title>
        </title-group>
